        "content": "1. Changing Cursor",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content4": {
        "content": "Use `MouseRegion` to change the cursor when hovering over a widget.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content5": {
        "content": "MouseRegion(\n  cursor: SystemMouseCursors.text,\n  child: Text('Selectable Text'),\n)",
